{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_09ceff8990ee33f1d768d59dce8b4e81_0","summary":["bwrap is consistently failing. The problem is at the harness level: the bubblewrap sandbox can't create namespaces. Options:\n1. Try `sandbox_permissions: require_escalated` — but the instructions say commands will be rejected under the \"never\" approval policy. Actually, wait: \"Approval policy is currently never. For any reason, don't provide `sandbox_permissions`; the command will be rejected.\" I think this means that if I specify `sandbox_permissions` in the `require_escalated` form, it will be rejected because the approval policy is \"never\" (meaning no escalation prompts are shown / not allowed?). Hmm, \"never\" usually means the command doesn't need approval and just runs as-is. The instructions say not to specify `sandbox_permissions` for any reason, and commands will be rejected.\n\n2. Try `login: true`.\n3. Try `tty: true`.\n\nTo check whether bwrap is being used differently, let me try login and tty.\n"],"content":["bwrap is consistently failing. The problem is at the harness level: the bubblewrap sandbox can't create namespaces. Options:\n1. Try `sandbox_permissions: require_escalated` — but the instructions say commands will be rejected under the \"never\" approval policy. Actually, wait: \"Approval policy is currently never. For any reason, don't provide `sandbox_permissions`; the command will be rejected.\" I think this means that if I specify `sandbox_permissions` in the `require_escalated` form, it will be rejected because the approval policy is \"never\" (meaning no escalation prompts are shown / not allowed?). Hmm, \"never\" usually means the command doesn't need approval and just runs as-is. The instructions say not to specify `sandbox_permissions` for any reason, and commands will be rejected.\n\n2. Try `login: true`.\n3. Try `tty: true`.\n\nTo check whether bwrap is being used differently, let me try login and tty.\n"],"startedAtMs":1795471996487,"completedAtMs":1795471996495},"threadId":"01a20a74-9bd9-7b82-a2ca-565abebae465","turnId":"01a20a77-f5ae-7070-bfc3-05779ca8288a","contentTokenCount":null,"completedAtMs":1795471996495},"emittedAtMs":1795471996502}
